FerrionOS change to pop-os libcosmic 1.0.0 (MPL-2.0 license, kept), made against pinned commits dd108aa99d7306110eef06da43eafc109e1ab151 and 430f3d48a97d8779f9c1985473912e594ccca1ae.

Enable wayland_platform on FerrionOS when the wayland feature is selected and keep orbital_platform active only when wayland is not enabled, keep x11_platform, xdg_portal and DBus crates excluded on redox, expose cctk and Wayland dependencies in the iced crates on redox, and populate PlatformSpecific::application_id on wayland_platform so windows carry their Wayland app_id.

